    heading: "agorartmjoinchannelfeature",
    content: "`1 &lt;&lt; 3`: Sets the silent mode. In this mode, the SDK has the following behaviors:- You can still receive other users' event notifications. - Event notifications related to your channel activity such as joining or leaving the channel, and actions related to setting, getting, or deleting temporary user states, can not be broadcasted to other users. - When calling the `getOnlineUsers` method, your information can not be found. - When calling the `getUserChannels` method, channels that you join in silent mode can not be detected."
